{"name": "Clockfall", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/ba3b372815d56e3abd80965fce3b751d.poster.avif?t=1786627675\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/ba3b372815d56e3abd80965fce3b751d.webm?t=1786627675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/ba3b372815d56e3abd80965fce3b751d.mp4?t=1786627675\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your village has fallen, razed by the hordes of the <i>Destiny</i>. But its downfall is only the beginning. A mystical clock now looms amidst the ruins, forcing you to relive the massacres from the past in a relentless loop. In these dreams, time is short and always runs out. Will you seize this cycle to defy fate and save your kin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The clock is ticking. Fight through the dungeons of your memories before time runs out. Danger is everywhere: prepare for fast-paced, visceral combat against the servants of the <i>Destiny</i>. Master the land to optimize your runs, gather resources, and unlock powerful weapons, spells, and lethal defenses to protect your village from the coming  invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is your ultimate resource, but your hero\u2019s lethality is just as vital. Every choice matters: forge your character and sharpen your strategy. You must strike a balance between gaining time and boosting your firepower. Master the synergy between dungeon crawling and village defense to finally break the loop and save your kin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a unique hybrid of Dungeon Crawler and Action-RPG, featuring intense village defense phases</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/e533b4a37fa8def3c7fd677c30a42c38.poster.avif?t=1786627675\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/e533b4a37fa8def3c7fd677c30a42c38.webm?t=1786627675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/e533b4a37fa8def3c7fd677c30a42c38.mp4?t=1786627675\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in visceral, fast-paced combat blending steel and magic, where roguelite elements constantly shift the rules and balancing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/fe982a823aca1f14a736ce19a89b49c3.poster.avif?t=1786627675\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/fe982a823aca1f14a736ce19a89b49c3.webm?t=1786627675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/fe982a823aca1f14a736ce19a89b49c3.mp4?t=1786627675\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep character progression and evolution directly shape your playstyle and overarching strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/862ad7ed8e656649379c96debe44a09d.poster.avif?t=1786627675\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/862ad7ed8e656649379c96debe44a09d.webm?t=1786627675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/862ad7ed8e656649379c96debe44a09d.mp4?t=1786627675\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, learn, adapt, die, and repeat - master the synergy between Dungeon Crawling and village defense to finally break the loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/76563b66d0b3e2c57d9167dc7be8511d.poster.avif?t=1786627675\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/76563b66d0b3e2c57d9167dc7be8511d.webm?t=1786627675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/extras/76563b66d0b3e2c57d9167dc7be8511d.mp4?t=1786627675\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Master the clock, break the loop. Time is limited and is the ultimate resource in this hybrid Dungeon Crawler packed with phases of village defense. Each run is a fight to earn more time, or unlock new weapons and skills to build your escape.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596470/4cf153c6c4992177ecc4d